{"productId": "97dce95d-bbbc-45f5-a00b-8e3fe7ffa0ee", "modelName": "Kodiak", "modelDescription": "Letting full-power 10mm loads achieve their potential, the long-slide Kodiak features a 6-inch bushing-less bull barrel.  Available in two finish variants, the Black version has bronzed controls and barrel while the tri-tone adds a matte gray slide to boot. Not only does that long barrel give the potent 10mm more time to build energy, the sight radius that comes with it allows for more accuracy as well as greater slide/barrel mass, reducing felt recoil and muzzle flip. Fully-adjustable sights are fitted with fiber optic rods for illumination, and a rail on the dustcover allows for the mounting of a light or laser. Reloads are made smoother by the addition of a magwell and an ambidextrous safety makes this 1911 a bit more lefty-friendly.", "manufacturerName": "Dan Wesson", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "23b44877-67e3-4ef9-bb5b-93961483d8a3", "description": "Dan Wesson, Kodiak, Semi-automatic, Full Size, 10MM, 6\" Barrel, Stainless Steel Frame, Duo Tone Finish, G10 Grips, 8 Rounds, Ambidextrous Safety, Fiber Optic Sights\n", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/7b65dc5b-cfd6-4060-af1f-dc060fa57500", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/070f1007-1f7e-4bc4-b186-ebc891e30077", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/b7bb3c74-707d-4614-b976-25e36206acf5", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/63758710-b941-4cc0-8e0c-abf7c63d3e46", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/bd125dbc-7974-4c1d-9f11-806ade5246e1", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/5c05c682-5f65-47f5-819a-1b8d628b9499", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/cf91ba48-7d5c-4e3d-bda1-a53bc7abb01c"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "01853", "upc": "806703018539", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "1dbab5b3-c07e-4fd5-93de-487557a9fe2d", "attributeName": "Factory Eq